                <pb facs="1516" n="1502" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg1502"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.34112A/8–2144: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Paraguay</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Reed</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-08-24T17:00:00-04:00">August 24, 1944—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>269. Proposal regarding Colegio Alemán contained in urtel 474, August 21, 7 p.m.,
                    satisfactory to Department. You are authorized to accept proposal stipulating 1)
                    immediate removal of Ketterer, 2) his relegation to restricted area, 3)
                    appointment of Paraguayan to handle school finances, 4) further action in
                    eliminating other objectionable elements November 15.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
